      "writtenOn": "2023-11-13T05:34:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "So now that you don\u0027t pass the `trackMultiNetworks` boolean, IIUC you only test the old behavior on old devices and the new behavior on new devices.\n\nNote that you could improve this by just calling mDeps.setBuildSdk() in the test, which would let you test both behaviors on both old and new builds, for added safety.",
