    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "7287f934_9dce9d6f",
        "filename": "tests/unit/java/com/android/server/ConnectivityServiceTest.java",
        "patchSetId": 97
      },
      "lineNbr": 11341,
      "author": {
        "id": 1947461
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-11-14T05:55:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Currently, return value of mDeps.isAtleastV() is stored to mTrackMultiNetworkActivities in the ConnectivityService constructor.\n\nTo test both behaviors on the single build, we need to update the code to call mDeps.isAtleastV() always or update test to recreate the ConnectivityService with different deps.\n\nI think the first solution could solve the issue for mTrackMultiNetworkActivities case, but can not solve some other cases (e.g. mDeps.isFeatureEnabled).\n\nSo I think we should do the second solution. But this requires some amount of work.\nFor this CL, let me keep the current code.",
      "parentUuid": "27336492_3b3c0ba1",
